MAIN
MOVE TEMP 18 4
MOVE TEMP 19 HALLOCATE TEMP 18
MOVE TEMP 4 TEMP 19
MOVE TEMP 20 4
MOVE TEMP 21 HALLOCATE TEMP 20
MOVE TEMP 5 TEMP 21
MOVE TEMP 22 D_funCall
HSTORE TEMP 5 0 TEMP 22
MOVE TEMP 23 TEMP 5
HSTORE TEMP 4 0 TEMP 23
MOVE TEMP 3 TEMP 4
HLOAD TEMP 6 TEMP 3 0
HLOAD TEMP 7 TEMP 6 0
MOVE TEMP 24 CALL TEMP 7 ( TEMP 3 )
PRINT TEMP 24
END
D_funCall [ 1 ]
BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 25 8
MOVE TEMP 26 HALLOCATE TEMP 25
MOVE TEMP 8 TEMP 26
MOVE TEMP 27 8
MOVE TEMP 28 HALLOCATE TEMP 27
MOVE TEMP 9 TEMP 28
MOVE TEMP 29 A_funA
HSTORE TEMP 9 0 TEMP 29
MOVE TEMP 30 A_funA2
HSTORE TEMP 9 4 TEMP 30
MOVE TEMP 31 0
MOVE TEMP 32 TEMP 31
HSTORE TEMP 8 4 TEMP 32
MOVE TEMP 33 TEMP 9
HSTORE TEMP 8 0 TEMP 33
MOVE TEMP 2 TEMP 8
MOVE TEMP 10 TEMP 2
HLOAD TEMP 11 TEMP 10 0
HLOAD TEMP 12 TEMP 11 0
MOVE TEMP 34 CALL TEMP 12 ( TEMP 10 )
MOVE TEMP 1 TEMP 34
PRINT TEMP 1
MOVE TEMP 13 TEMP 2
HLOAD TEMP 14 TEMP 13 0
HLOAD TEMP 15 TEMP 14 4
MOVE TEMP 35 CALL TEMP 15 ( TEMP 13 )
MOVE TEMP 1 TEMP 35
PRINT TEMP 1
MOVE TEMP 36 1

RETURN TEMP 36
END
A_funA [ 1 ]
BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 37 100
MOVE TEMP 1 TEMP 37
MOVE TEMP 38 10
MOVE TEMP 39 PLUS TEMP 1 TEMP 38
MOVE TEMP 1 TEMP 39
PRINT TEMP 1

RETURN TEMP 1
END
A_funA2 [ 1 ]
BEGIN
HLOAD TEMP 16 TEMP 0 4
MOVE TEMP 40 50
MOVE TEMP 41 MINUS TEMP 16 TEMP 40
MOVE TEMP 42 TEMP 41
HSTORE TEMP 0 4 TEMP 42
HLOAD TEMP 17 TEMP 0 4

RETURN TEMP 17
END

